WEBVTT

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:45.340
Again, another place with no people at all!

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.910
We'll never find Mom and Dad like this.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.940
There really is nothing here, is there?

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.580
What's up, Chobi?

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.150
I feel the spirit of some living thing.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:11.870
What's that?

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:39.090
A herd of chocobo!

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:09.190
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:09.190
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:16.690
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:16.690
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:25.800
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:25.800
With our eyes on the future

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:31.910
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:31.910
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:41.550
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:41.550
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:49.060
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:49.060
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:54.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:54.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:04.270
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:04.270
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:17.120
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:22.090
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.660
The mansion where devilish flowers
bloomed in abundance...

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:30.840
Malice and old memories are brought together.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.470
Don't forget

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:38.810
this pure heart that thinks of her
even inside a dream.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.780
Those feelings will surely touch the sky.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.080
It will soar over the light of destruction,

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:51.150
and fly to the sky far away.

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:05.860
It's a herd of chocobo!

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.280
They're being chased!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.350
Get back!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.260
Hurry!

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.360
Ai, Yu, let's hurry up and get far away
before he turns any bigger!

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:11.670
Chobi!

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:12.570
This can't be good!

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:15.430
Run!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.620
How brutal.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:43.300
Chobi...

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:53.700
Amazing...

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.980
You did a great job!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.090
Chomp?

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.440
You are quite handsome, aren't you?

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:24.200
That kick you did back there
reminds me of the legendary Ciel.

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:28.980
Are you by any chance Chocobaba?

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:33.250
Hey there, that feather is a penna, isn't it?

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:37.450
You've met Chocobaba, haven't you?

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.620
What is a penna?

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.590
You're not Chocobaba?

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.390
Who in the world are you?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.990
I am the younger sister of the
chocobo-loving Chocobaba.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.100
I am Chocoimo!

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.830
Chocoimo?

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.670
Or something like that.

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:59.710
Something like that...

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.870
They say they all love you, Sis!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.300
I don't want them to love me!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.930
Let me go!

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:25.230
Do you always travel with these Chocobo?

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:28.940
Let me see...

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:34.400
We are in search of the kids' parents,
have you seen them around anywhere?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.280
Let me see...

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.890
We've been constantly on the run lately, so...

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.290
Away from that monster?

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:51.960
There are many, many other monsters
all over Wonderland.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.800
Or something like that.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:05.110
Ai! Yu! It doesn't seem like we're
going to find any clues here.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.850
Let's get back to the Subway and be on our way.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:11.790
That's right, if Omega were to show up,
it'd be the end for you guys.

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:12.880
Omega?!

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.510
Is Omega still around here?!

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.920
Let me see...

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:21.420
But it's destroying things everywhere
and causing a stir.

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.130
Or something like that.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:29.900
Okay, from now on, no more of that
"Let me see," or "Something like that" crap!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.930
Omega was the one who attacked us
on the Subway, right?

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:50.350
<i>He survived that after all. Either that, or...</i>

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.080
What in the world is that Omega thing anyway?!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.590
Oh, this is an emergency!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.820
Hey!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.100
Lou told us about him.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.940
Pieces of Omega are scattered
all over Wonderland.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.340
And that part that attacked us
was the claw, right?

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.510
So there are still more like it around.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:18.420
It would be great if Ciel were here.

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:21.580
Who is Ciel?

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.260
The legendary Ciel chocobo.

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.450
Ciel chocobo?

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.830
What kind of chocobo was he?

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:34.230
He was undefeated in the chocobo
race held in Chocobo City.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:38.300
The prize money made him so rich
that he lived a blissful life

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.270
and he could just relax all day.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.540
Or something like that.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.580
How is that supposed to help us?

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.610
Let me see...

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:56.660
The Subway is leaving!

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:57.750
We've got to hurry!

00:09:58.560 --> 00:09:59.860
Okay, Chocoimo, we'll...

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.130
Set off! Or something like that.

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:04.460
So quick!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.270
Okay, shall we go back to the Subway?

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.530
Let's go!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.070
Just when they had become friends.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.090
Chobi...

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:33.330
You want to go with them, don't you?

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:53.080
Go ahead, Chobi.
Wonderland is constantly moving.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:57.520
If you don't join them now, there's no
telling when you'll see them again.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:05.290
I know how you feel. I want to be
with Mom and Dad too.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:07.130
So...

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.900
We'll be fine. Hurry!

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:29.970
Yu...

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.120
We'd better hurry! We'll be late for the Subway!

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:38.530
Yu...

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:05.720
The Subway's running outside!

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:08.150
This is the first time, isn't it?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.290
Do you suppose we've made it back
to the Outside World?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:19.060
What is that light?

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:37.710
A monster?!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.650
It looks creepy!

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.580
This horrifying spirit...

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.160
It's the same as Omega's.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.750
Then is that Omega?

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.650
Its shape is different than before.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.130
That time it was Omega's claw.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:54.220
This must be a different part of his body.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.300
The Subway didn't come outside!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:05.000
All of the land above it was scoured away!

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:14.040
It's coming over here!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.210
This doesn't look good!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:21.830
It's coming!

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:23.830
Get down!

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.560
The Subway...

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.450
Are you all right?

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.680
Yeah, what about Yu?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.350
Yu!

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:54.550
Yu!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.290
We can't get to him!

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:00.160
Yu! Yu!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:02.970
Kaze!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.000
Mister!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:09.480
Help! Help Yu! Hey!

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:13.080
I'm talking to you! Can't you hear me?!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.510
Say something!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:17.590
Why are you always like that?!

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:19.420
It wouldn't hurt to help us a little!

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:22.850
Cheapskate! Cheapskate! You big cheapskate!

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:24.290
Ai...

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:28.950
<i>Why...</i>

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:51.850
Wow, I can't believe it, but this must be it!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:55.050
This is the legendary Ciel Monolith!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:57.650
Oh, I'm so grateful, so grateful!

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:00.230
I never expected to find it in my lifetime.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:03.590
The legend of Ciel was true!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.360
Or something like that.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.830
You guys must have heard of the legendary Ciel!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:16.740
It's the glorious mystery passed on
from one strong chocobo to another!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.740
This is pitiful!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.610
Over time the number of strong
chocobo has decreased,

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:29.420
the heir has been lost, and the Ciel
has been sealed away.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.920
And no wonder.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:36.890
What with you guys, his descendants,
being like this...

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.940
Awesome or something like that!

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.890
What was that?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.060
This spirit I feel...

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.870
No way! Is that a chocobo?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.300
We're flying!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.310
You saved me?

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:27.140
Chobi? It's Chobi, right?!

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:33.480
Yu! That bird...

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:34.920
I'm so glad you're all right.

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.950
It's Chobi! He came for me!

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.750
He became the Ciel chocobo to save us!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.300
Awesome!

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:45.460
So what kind of stuff can he do now?

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:50.500
He said he can fly now!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.840
Is that it?

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:03.640
It has moved.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:08.050
Soil is my power!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.940
The Magun has thawed!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:49.930
Hurry!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.900
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:06.280
The solid earth that protects,
Gaia Brown!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:16.780
The hidden, silent passion,
Deep Vermillion!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:26.660
And finally, the eternal vitality
of life, Evergreen!

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:40.170
Smash! I summon you, Titan!

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:20.220
It's ringing!

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:21.690
The Subway!

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:22.690
There it is!

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:23.880
Let's go, Chobi!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.680
He changed back into his old self.

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:59.920
Now I can tell that it's our same old Chobi.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:02.890
Even though you were always a bird,
you could never fly until now.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.500
It doesn't seem like he can stay
changed for a very long time.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:16.230
I wonder what happened to
Omega and that guy?

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.710
I wouldn't worry about Kaze.

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:20.510
That kind of thing always happens to him.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:24.710
So Chobi, are you sure you don't
have to go back to your friends?

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:28.680
What did he say?

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:32.380
He said we get into so much trouble
that he'd be too worried.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.730
Thank you, Chobi!

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:44.200
I'm seeing all sorts of colors...

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:18.860
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.770
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:28.230
Mushroom, mushroom, mushroom...

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:35.540
The anger of the Magun erupts in the face of the
coldhearted henchmen searching for Omega.

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:43.920
Next time, I'll return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
